### 5. Fazer Login com Marcos (Armazena o token automaticamente)
# @name loginReq
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "marcos@gmail.com",
    "senha": "123"
}

### 6. Listar Todos os clientes (Privado)
GET http://localhost:3000/clientes
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 7. Consultar cliente por ID (Privado)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 8. Consultar cliente por Nome (Route Param)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/buscarNome/Marcos
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 9. Consultar cliente por Nome Inexistente (Deve retornar 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/cliente/buscarNome/Nome Inexistente
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

### 10. Atualizar cliente 1 (Privado)
PUT http://localhost:3000/cliente/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "nome": "Marcos",
    "email": "marcos@gmail.com",
    "endereco": "Rua das Flores, 456",
    "celular": "48999998888"
}

### 11. Cadastrar Veiculo 1 (Marcos)
POST http://localhost:3000/veiculo
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{loginReq.response.body.token}}

{
    "modelo": "saveiro surf",
    "marca": "volkswagen",
    "placa": "1234567",
    "codigoRastreio": "12",
    "idCliente": 1
}

